---
// Page-wide margin guides, aligned to half the content gutter.
---
<div aria-hidden="true" class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-y-0 left-1/2 w-[min(70rem,100%)] -translate-x-1/2">
  <i class="absolute inset-y-0 left-[calc(var(--gutter)/2)] w-px bg-guide"></i>
  <i class="absolute inset-y-0 right-[calc(var(--gutter)/2)] w-px bg-guide"></i>
</div>
